      "markdown": "1 WPH(Water Per Hour): Theoretical unit throughput by recipe\n\nPeak WPH: The throughput under continuous run status\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-SwsvNd3Saz6USLketV4qkI21KGmQw9NU/0-4.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A52%3A39Z%2F2592000%2F%2Ffd06cbe4a35cb8c9449f10c9f67765c91729f20efde5cf8fe20d905742bd0cf6\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"94%\" /></div>\n\n\n $$ \\textcircled{4}{~}={\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\\it M o v e~o f~r e c i p e i}}{\\mathrm{T h e o r e t i c a l~p r o d u c t i o n~t i m e~b y~r e c i p e i~}}}=\\quad\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\\it M o v e~o f~r e c i p e i}}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\\frac{\\mathrm{M o v e~o f~r e c i p e i}}{\\mathrm{P e a k~W P H~b y~r e c i p e i}}}} $$ \n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-SwsvNd3Saz6USLketV4qkI21KGmQw9NU/0-6.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A52%3A39Z%2F2592000%2F%2F96f4c1061385e7db575b678a3185039107a2e91e14227b5e24037628c49e502f\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\nThe average speed?  $ (6+3)/2=4.5\\text{m/s} $?  $ \\times (30+60)/(20/6+60/3)=3.6\\text{m/s} $? ✓\n\nRecipe 1: PWPH 1=20, move 1=1000\n\nRecipe 2: PWPH 2=25, move 2=1500\n\nAverage PWPH: 1000+1500)/(1000/20+1500/25)=22.7",
